msgstr "Send a new data packet and return the SN used."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:236
msgid "收到 ACK: 翻转 SN, 清除重传状态。"
msgstr "ACK received: toggle SN and clear retransmission state."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:244
msgid "收到 NACK: 决定是否重传。"
msgstr "NACK received: decide whether to retransmit."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:246
msgid "异步链路: 持续重传直到收到 ACK。 同步链路: 超出 max_retransmit 后丢弃。"
msgstr ""
"Async link: keep retransmitting until ACK is received. Sync link: discard"
" after exceeding max_retransmit."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:252
msgid "未收到反馈: 与 NACK 处理相同。"
msgstr "No feedback received: handled the same as NACK."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:260
msgid "接收数据包, 返回是否为新数据。"
msgstr "Receive a data packet and return whether it is new data."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:262
msgid "若 rx_sn == expected_rx_sn: 新数据, 反馈 ACK。 否则: 重复包, 仍反馈 ACK。"
msgstr ""
"If rx_sn == expected_rx_sn: new data, feedback ACK. Otherwise: duplicate "
"packet, still feedback ACK."

