msgid "管理 HARQ 反馈字段 (8 bit) 和 CBG 级部分重传逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"Manage the HARQ feedback field (8 bit) and CBG-level partial "
"retransmission logic."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:382
msgid ""
"TB 模式: harq_feedback 指示期望对端传输的数据包 SN。 CBG 模式: harq_feedback 每 bit 对应一个 "
"CBG 的 ACK/NACK。"
msgstr ""
"TB mode: harq_feedback indicates the expected SN for the remote end to "
"transmit. CBG mode: each bit of harq_feedback corresponds to the ACK/NACK"
" of one CBG."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:407
msgid "编码 HARQ 反馈字段 (8 bit)。"
msgstr "Encode the HARQ feedback field (8 bit)."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:409
msgid "TB 模式: 返回期望对端传输的 SN。 CBG 模式: 返回 CBG ACK/NACK bitmap。"
msgstr ""
"TB mode: return the SN expected from the remote end. CBG mode: return CBG"
" ACK/NACK bitmap."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:415
msgid "解码 HARQ 反馈字段。"
msgstr "Decode the HARQ feedback field."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:417
msgid "TB 模式: 返回 [全部 ACK] 或 [全部 NACK]。 CBG 模式: 返回每个 CBG 的 ACK 状态。"
msgstr ""
"TB mode: return [all ACK] or [all NACK]. CBG mode: return each CBG ACK "
"status."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:423
msgid "更新 CBG 接收状态。"
msgstr "Update CBG receive state."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:431
msgid "是否需要 CBG 级部分重传。"
msgstr "Whether CBG-level partial retransmission is needed."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:439
msgid "获取需要重传的 CBG 掩码 (用于 B1 控制信息 data_length 字段)。"
msgstr ""
"Get the CBG mask for retransmission (for the B1 control info data_length "
"field)."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:441
msgid "标准 6.5.1.1: MCS=15 时, data_length 低 M bit 指示需要传输的 CBG。"
msgstr ""
"Standard 6.5.1.1: when MCS=15, the lower M bits of data_length indicate "
"the CBGs to be transmitted."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:447
msgid "综合 HARQ 反馈决定发送行为。"
msgstr "Determine transmission behavior based on comprehensive HARQ feedback."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:455
msgid "重置 CBG 状态 (新数据传输前)。"
msgstr "Reset CBG state (before new data transmission)."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:475
msgid "跟踪最近 N 帧的 CRC 通过率, 计算瞬时 FER, 根据 FER 阈值建议 MCS 调整方向。"
msgstr ""
"Track the CRC pass rate of the last N frames, compute instantaneous FER, "
"and recommend MCS adjustment direction based on FER thresholds."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/qos.py:478
msgid "标准: 控制信息 LQI 字段 (前 4 bit 为 MCS 指示)。"
msgstr "Standard: control info LQI field (first 4 bits are MCS indication)."

